# Corpses for side-scrolling scenes, 32x32 cells, lying on the floor at the
# bottom edge: a student face down, an office worker on his back with his eyes
# open, a body slumped against the wall, head on its chest.
# GORE SET (optional): hidden when the "gore" option is off; see docs/decisions.md D9.
@palette ../palette/night-school.pal
@size 32 32
@output ../characters/gore_corpses.png
@preview ../previews/gore_corpses_x4.png 4
@columns 3

